ExactFillSettler_finaliseAsRefunded
├── when _hashOrder(order) is not equal to orderId
│   └── it should revert with DigestMismatch
├── when block.timestamp is at or before order.fillDeadline
│   └── it should revert with NotExpired
├── when orderStatus is None
│   └── it should revert with InvalidOrderStatus
├── when orderStatus is Settled
│   └── it should revert with OrderComplete
├── when orderStatus is Refunded
│   └── it should revert with InvalidOrderStatus
├── when orderStatus is Cancelled
│   └── it should revert with InvalidOrderStatus
├── when orderStatus is Opened AND paymentSettled is true
│   └── it should revert with OrderComplete
├── when orderStatus is Opened AND rollover leg filled AND paymentSettled is false
│   └── it should dstCST.safeTransfer the escrowed dstCstProduced to cellar, transition status from Opened to Refunded, and emit OrderFinalised with status Refunded
└── when orderStatus is Opened AND both legs un-filled
    └── it should transition status from Opened to Refunded and transfer zero tokens
